ing with Reality Ruler: 3D Measurement in MR! Our app utilizes the device's pass-through mode to turn your environment into a digital workspace for measurement.\n\nFeatures:\n\nMeasure Line Lengths: Draw lines in real space and get their lengths instantly.\nArea Calculations: Evaluate the area of polygons, rectangles, and circles with simple gestures.\nAngles: Get precise angles between intersecting lines in 3D space.\nVolumetrics: Estimate the volume of 3D shapes like cuboids, cylinders, cones, and spheres.\nReality Ruler offers an intuitive interface and simple controls, making it easy for anyone to get started. Whether you're a student learning geometry, a carpenter planning a project, or simply someone who wants to better understand the space around them, Reality Ruler provides an accurate and interactive way to measure the world.\n\nTurn your Headset into a powerful measurement tool with Reality Ruler: 3D Measurement in MR.", "short_description": "Measure real-world objects in 3D using your Headset's pass-through mode. Calculate length, area, angles, and volume effortlessly with Reality Ruler."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.visionxr.co.in/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VisionXR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.visionxr.co.in/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_